  ? 'Compare North-central Penobscot sections from T3 R11 and Medway through Lincoln, Howland, Passadumkeag, and Milford, plus the Bangor Valley and tidal estuary. Check West Enfield or Bangor gauge context and public access for your exact trip.'
  : isCedarRiverAdirondacksHub
