  : isSaludaHub
  ? 'Plan the 3.5-mile upper Lower Saluda reach from either Saluda Shoals Park or Hope Ferry to Gardendale. Compare the two public launch choices, carry-in take-out, below-dam gauge context and downstream rapid boundary.'
